  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Consider following events<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> : Person chosen is a smoker and non<br />vegetarian.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;:&nbsp;Person chosen is a smoker and vegetarian.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;:&nbsp;Person chosen is a non-smoker and vegetarian</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math>&nbsp;:&nbsp;Person chosen has a chest disorder</p><p>Given</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>160</mn><mn>400</mn></mfrac><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mn>400</mn></mfrac><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>140</mn><mn>400</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>35</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>To find</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>160</mn><mn>400</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>35</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>160</mn><mn>400</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>35</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mn>400</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>140</mn><mn>400</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>28</mn><mn>45</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>option <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p>",
